diff --git a/design/20-campaign-experience/WEAPON_COMBOS.md b/design/20-campaign-experience/WEAPON_COMBOS.md
index b9a38192..6c05c665 100644
--- a/design/20-campaign-experience/WEAPON_COMBOS.md
